text = "TLDR

Clean up rounds are short BUFFER EVENTS before combat rounds. 
You have 20 seconds to clean up those vermin mounds that spawn  around the map. 
This is a great opportuninty to acquire some extra cash to purchase weapon upgrades.

- Starting combat will start with a Clean Up round
- Beating a Round will Conclude in an Clean Up Intermission Round prior to starting the next

Hold \"SPACE BAR\" to skip the Clean Up Round and proceed to the combat phase.

Good Luck!"

